{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964660/extras/991cbab5fc49eb74670472d819c83f4a.avif?t=1761606365\" width=501 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Night Shippers</strong> is a 1\u20134 player co-op horror comedy where you and your friends take food delivery gigs in the afterlife. Every night, you\u2019ll face haunted streets, angry spirits, and impossible routes that change each run. Make it back to base before dawn... if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT'S INSIDE THIS DEMO VERSION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Playable maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Monster types and 3 variants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ functional items &amp; 20 cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 Roguelite contracts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Weather types &amp; random events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Stat upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Languages supported: English, Simplified Chinese, Vietnamese, Traditional Chinese, Russian, Korean, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese (BR), Spanish (Latam), French, German.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's NOT included:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboard ranking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional maps, story missions, and roguelite progression planned for full release</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DELIVER IN HELL CO-OP OR SOLO:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to 4 players \u2014 or go it alone \u2014 to take on cursed deliveries in haunted streets.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVERY SHIFT IS DIFFERENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two nights are ever the same - weather, ghosts, and events are procedurally generated for endless replayability.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE NIGHT TO ESCAPE HELL:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid traps, outrun monsters, and fight to see the sunrise.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROGUELITE UGRADES &amp; ITEMS:\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick different <strong>contracts</strong> that randomize missions and alter gameplay conditions each night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock tools and upgrades to stack the odds in your favor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964660/extras/a8987ade8ff4311e74bff2a0f64a9f98.webp?t=1761606365\" width=500 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964660/extras/b7029f75d91efffbbc502804bb000a2a.poster.avif?t=1761606365\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964660/extras/b7029f75d91efffbbc502804bb000a2a.webm?t=1761606365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964660/extras/82494f53e413ba8fb44ea036a28f5048.poster.avif?t=1761606365\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964660/extras/82494f53e413ba8fb44ea036a28f5048.webm?t=1761606365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Team up with up to 4 players to take on cursed delivery jobs across haunted towns, temples, and underworld streets. Laugh, scream, and hustle to survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964660/extras/4fa7ff1ee6686a051c36d485bb8586c3.webp?t=1761606365\" width=500 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964660/extras/e5bafb9f524f04c33d0559297e7ec89c.poster.avif?t=1761606365\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964660/extras/e5bafb9f524f04c33d0559297e7ec89c.webm?t=1761606365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964660/extras/f3c3fc63abef3b83fdc7a2f7fe9f45a5.poster.avif?t=1761606365\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964660/extras/f3c3fc63abef3b83fdc7a2f7fe9f45a5.webm?t=1761606365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dodge traps, outsmart monsters, and uncover hidden shortcuts to finish your deliveries before sunrise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964660/extras/9ef0c80753e6e8d04b744f9b9529deab.webp?t=1761606365\" width=500 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964660/extras/ba9231b14a94e2eb09eccfcfa16b9e03.poster.avif?t=1761606365\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964660/extras/ba9231b14a94e2eb09eccfcfa16b9e03.webm?t=1761606365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No two nights are ever the same:  weather, ghosts, and events are procedurally generated for endless replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964660/extras/55dc78aacb5a35bee399432466abe745.webp?t=1761606365\" width=500 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cl